          "Several related claims",
          "Define the family before interpreting significance. Holm controls the chance of at least one false rejection within that family, under valid marginal tests."
        ],
        [
          "Prespecified or orthogonal contrasts",
          "Planning improves focus but does not automatically give familywise error control. Correlated contrasts do not invalidate Holm."
        ],
        [
          "Your two questions in one regime",
